@@@!atrep-exo
@=bibliogramma=>bib

@@/ biblatex export (the default .bib): the lossless surface -
@@/ every genus and campus of the regular census has a biblatex
@@/ counterpart. Genus variants pick the entry type; term-keyed
@@/ rules translate the Latin campi; unknown genera and fields
@@/ pass through verbatim (Tier C machinery like crossref rides
@@/ through untouched for biber to resolve).

@-> *document
@(grammata)
>-@

@-> *paragraph
@(grammata)
>-@

